        <a href="#section-7" class="toc-link"><span class="toc-num">07</span> AI 与流媒体解锁：机房 IP vs 原生住宅 IP</a>
        <a href="#section-8" class="toc-link"><span class="toc-num">08</span> 场景决策树：不同人群预算选型指南</a>
